## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Nathan-Fielder.md`

### Central Thesis
Fielder's elaborate preparation isn't self-sufficiency, it's a purchase order for someone else's confirmation — which is why no single confirmation ever closes the question, from a woman on a Westwood sidewalk to a theatre full of strangers at Telluride.

